OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of murdering man found
OL,4,Ainjured in hospital car park           
OL,6,FA 25-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,7,Faccused of murdering a man who died    
OL,8,Fafter being found seriously injured in 
OL,9,Fa hospital car park in Dundee.         
OL,11,FJayden Gray appeared in private at     
OL,12,FForfar Sheriff Court accused of        
OL,13,Fmurdering 21-year-old Reece Massie.    
OL,15,FGray, from Dundee, is also accused of  
OL,16,Fcommitting a breach of the peace and   
OL,17,Fpossessing a blade in a public place.  
OL,19,FHe made no plea and was remanded in    
OL,20,Fcustody.                               
